#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0366A expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "RANDDT is NOT declared. Requirements.Variables.All lists both RANDDT and RANDFL, so the absent RANDDT gates the rule to SKIPPED with the variable named - the auditable-skip contract this All entry buys. The single row carries RANDFL=Y, i.e. exactly the state that would fire if RANDDT were declared and blank."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL structure=ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col RANDFL  type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | Y
